d standards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产用房\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Physical facilities used for production activities, subject to controlled renovation and upgrades.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"业扩报装配套\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Projects supporting new customer connections, such as equipment upgrades and hazard remediation, funded through project reserve packages.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包结算报告\"<|>\"发票\"<|>\"Invoice is a required component of the subcontract settlement report, especially when verifying payment and matching contract type.\"<|>\"documentation requirement, compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包结算报告\"<|>\"转账凭证\"<|>\"Payment proof must accompany the settlement report to confirm fund disbursement to subcontractors.\"<|>\"financial verification, payment traceability\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"审定报告\"<|>\"分包结算报告\"<|>\"When settlement exceeds contract value, an audit report is mandatory to support the higher amount.\"<|>\"compliance, validation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"劳务分包\"<|>\"工日单价\"<|>\"Labor subcontracting agreements may specify daily rates for different job types, enabling calculation based on man-days.\"<|>\"contractual pricing, labor cost calculation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"劳务分包\"<|>\"综合工日单价\"<|>\"A single rate applied across multiple labor tasks, calculated based on confirmed workdays.\"<|>\"unified labor pricing, efficiency measurement\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"劳务分包\"<|>\"计件单价\"<|>\"Labor pay can be based on output volume, allowing for flexible pricing models depending on workload.\"<|>\"performance-based pay, output tracking\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"定额结算\"<|>\"材料费\"<|>\"In fixed-rate settlement methods, material costs must be deducted to avoid double counting.\"<|>\"cost allocation, exclusion of materials\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技改结算报告\"<|>\"竣工验收\"<|>\"The report must be uploaded within 60 days after project completion and acceptance.\"<|>\"timeline compliance, post-completion requirement\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|