    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"改造实施步骤\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '改造实施步骤' refers to a structured process detailing the work content and power outage coordination requirements for each phase of a system renovation project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"施工图卷册安排\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"'施工图卷册安排' is a section specifying the detailed directory of construction drawings by discipline during the construction drawing phase.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"主要设备材料清册\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"'主要设备材料清册' is a list of key equipment and materials, including electrical primary, secondary, automation, communication systems, and demolition equipment, prepared based on preliminary design recommendations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"架空线路工程初设内容深度的具体要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category outlines the required depth and detail for the preliminary design of overhead line engineering projects, covering technical, economic, and procedural aspects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电缆工程初设内容深度的具体要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category specifies the required level of detail in the preliminary design for cable engineering projects, including path planning, material selection, and environmental considerations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"总论部分\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '总论部分' provides an overview of design basis, project background, objectives, standards, and scope of work, along with technical and economic indicators.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '电力系统' section describes the role and necessity of the line within the power system, outage impacts, preliminary outage plans, and integration with protection, automation, and communication systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"线路路径\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '线路路径' section details the planning basis, route alignment, geological and environmental conditions, transition schemes, and cross-impact assessments for the line's path.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"气象条件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '气象条件' section defines the design meteorological conditions for the project, including special condition analysis and justification based on data sources and calculations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"导线和地线选择\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category covers the selection of conductor and ground wire types, specifications, tension values, and mechanical/electrical characteristics based on system requirements and existing conditions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"绝缘配合\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '绝缘配合' section determines insulation levels, pollution zone classification, insulator selection, and air gap values for safe and reliable operation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"防雷与接地\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '防雷与接地' section addresses lightning protection methods, ground wire configuration, soil resistivity, and grounding system design requirements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"防振措施\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '防振措施' section evaluates whether vibration prevention is needed based on operating tension and specifies corresponding design principles and measures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"杆塔、基础型式及地质概况\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category includes the selection of tower types, foundation forms, and geological conditions along the route, with considerations for typical designs, existing structures, and new or modified components.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"交叉跨越\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '交叉跨越' section establishes control standards and handling principles for crossings over other infrastructure, including impact assessment and quantity estimation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"存在问题及建议\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '存在问题及建议' section identifies technical challenges such as unknown geology, underground pipelines, and coordination issues, and offers recommendations from the design perspective.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"停电方案设计\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The '停电方案设计' includes planned outages for the renovation project, and may include temporary connection or temporary power supply solutions when necessary.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"主要设备材料内容\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category lists the core materials and equipment involved in the renovation, including conductors, ground wires, optical cables, insulators, fittings, steel, cement, wood, and other professional materials, with details on quantity, specifications, and inclusion of tools or spare parts.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"主要拆除设备清单及处置意见\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category contains a list of equipment to be removed during the renovation and provides recommendations for their disposal.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.1\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.1 corresponds to the '总论部分' of the overhead line engineering preliminary design, outlining design basis, project context, and scope.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.2\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.2 covers the '电力系统' aspect of overhead line engineering, focusing on system role, outage planning, and coordination with protection and communication systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.3\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.3 details the '线路路径' planning for overhead lines, including geographical and environmental factors, alignment, and transition strategies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.4\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.4 specifies the '气象条件' used in the design, including special case analysis and justification for meteorological parameters.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.5\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.5 addresses the '导线和地线选择' based on system capacity and operational conditions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.6\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.6 focuses on '绝缘配合', determining insulation levels and air gap requirements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.7\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.7 deals with '防雷与接地' design, including lightning protection and grounding system specifications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.8\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.8 discusses '防振措施' based on tension and operational demands.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.9.1\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.9.1 covers '杆塔型式' selection and evaluation criteria, including use of existing or new towers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.9.2\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.9.2 provides the '地质概况' based on geological surveys along the route.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.9.3\"<|>\"category\"<