upervises and evaluates local implementation, and organizes reviews and approvals for designated projects within its branch.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司分部调控分中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Company Branch Dispatching Sub-center manages preliminary design, review, and approval for assets directly maintained by the branch, based on professional responsibilities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位运检部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Local Units' Operation & Maintenance Departments implement company regulations, organize preliminary design work for their units and entrusted assets, and conduct evaluations and assessments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位安质、信通、物资、调控部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Local Units' Safety & Quality, Information & Communication, Material, and Dispatching Departments are responsible for organizing preliminary design, review, and approval of projects related to directly maintained assets within their units.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网经研院\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Economic Research Institute is responsible for reviewing preliminary design documents for relevant projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省（自治区、直辖市）经研院\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial (Autonomous Region, Municipality) Economic Research Institutes conduct preliminary design reviews, including those for provincial maintenance companies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"地市公司经研所\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Municipal Company Economic Research Institutes carry out preliminary design review tasks for assigned projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技术改造和设备大修项目初步设计\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category refers to the preliminary design phase of technical renovation and equipment overhaul projects, which includes detailed planning, cost estimation, and review procedures to ensure compliance with project requirements and budget constraints.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可行性研究报告\"<|>\"document\"<|>\"A document that provides foundational analysis for project justification, approved before preliminary design begins, serving as a reference for design scope and 