erified report required for full settlement documentation, including design, supervision, construction, and commissioning data.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"PMS模板\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A standardized template (PMS) used for comprehensive settlement reports covering all aspects of a project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"编、审、批签字\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Required sign-offs from preparer, reviewer, and approver on the settlement documents to validate authenticity and compliance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"汇总表及明细表\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Two components of the settlement book: a summary table and detailed breakdown, with mutual consistency required.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"送审结算书\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A preliminary version of the settlement document submitted for review, which can be stamped but not signed by project managers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"最终审定结算\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The officially approved and finalized settlement document, requiring signature and seal from project management personnel.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"概算\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Initial budget estimate for a project, against which actual settlement amounts should align.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Legal agreement specifying project scope, cost, and terms, serving as a benchmark for settlement and adjustments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"费率承包\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A contracting model where pricing is based on a percentage or rate, requiring consideration of discount ratios during settlement.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"纯物资项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Projects involving only procurement of materials, with no construction labor involved, thus no construction fee should be settled.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"全部自主实施项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Projects fully carried out internally without external subcontracting, hence no construction fee should be included in settlement.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"虚列工程量\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Fraudulent practice of inflating quantities in the settlement, including duplicate charges for commissioning or unrelated tasks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设计变更/签证/计划调整/合同变更\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Supporting documents required to justify discrepancies between contract and settlement volumes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工决算表\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Official document summarizing the final financial status of a completed project, required for project closure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工决算审核报告\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Third-party verified report confirming the accuracy of the final project financials.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工投运\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The official commissioning and operational start-up of a project, marking the end of construction phase.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急抢修项目\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Projects initiated due to urgent failures or emergencies, prioritized for implementation and adjustment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"紧急缺陷及重大隐患治理项目\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Projects addressing critical faults or significant safety risks, eligible for priority funding and adjustment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急备案审批单\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Official document issued by relevant departments to confirm the legitimacy of emergency projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"数字化项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Projects related to digital transformation or systems, excluded from adjustment plans.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"钓鱼项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A prohibited practice of creating projects with artificially low initial investment to gain approval, later increased in scale.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"视频会议系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"An information system project, deemed non-urgent and not essential for grid operation, thus ineligible for inclusion in adjustment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"管理系统平台改造\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A system upgrade project, not critical to grid operations, thus generally excluded from adjustment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"指挥中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A specialized facility managing operations, subject to strict standards and restricted expansion.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"管控中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A central control center overseeing project execution and performance, governed by unified standards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产用房\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Physical facilities used for production activities, subject to controlled renovation and upgrades.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"业扩报装配套\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Projects supporting new customer connections, such as equipment upgrades and hazard remediation, funded through project reserve packages.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包结算报告\"<|>\"发票\"<|>\"Invoice is a required component of the subcontract settlement report, especially when verifying payment and matching contract type.\"<|>\"documentation requirement, compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包结算报告\"<|>\"转账凭证\"<|>\"Payment proof must accompany the settlement report to confirm fund disbursement to subcontractors.\"<|>\"financial verification, payment traceability\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"审定报告\"<|>\"分包结算报告\"<|>\"When settlement exceeds contract value, an audit report is mandatory to support the higher amount.\"<|>\"compliance, validation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"劳务分包\"<|>\"工日单价\"<|>\"Labor subcontracting agreements may specify daily rates for different job types, enabling calculation based on man-days.\"<|>\"contractual pricing, labor cost calculation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"劳务分包\"<|>\"综合工日单价\"<|>\"A single rate applied across multiple labor tasks, calculated based on confirmed workdays.\"<|>\"unified labor pricing, efficiency measurement\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"劳务分包\"<|>\"计件单价\"<|>\"Labor pay can be based on output volume, allowing for flexible pricing models depending on workload.\"<|>\"performance-based pay, output tracking\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"定额结算\"<|>\"材料费\"<|>\"In fixed-rate settlement methods, material costs must be deducted to avoid double counting.\"<|>\"cost allocation, exclusion of materials\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技改结算报告\"<|>\"竣工验收\"<|>\"The report must be uploaded within 60 days after project completion and acceptance.\"<|>\"timeline compliance, post-completion requirement\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|