    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Grid Company is a major state-owned enterprise responsible for the management and operation of power systems in China. It establishes regulations and standards for technical renovation and equipment overhaul projects, particularly focusing on preliminary design compilation and review processes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Operation & Maintenance Department is responsible for executing national laws, industry standards, and company regulations; it formulates management rules, oversees and evaluates preliminary design work, and conducts reviews and approvals for designated projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网安质部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Safety & Quality Department is involved in the preparation, review, and approval of preliminary designs for headquarters-maintained assets, in coordination with other specialized departments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"信通部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Information & Communication Department handles the preliminary design work for headquarters-maintained assets related to information and communication systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Material Department participates in the preparation, review, and approval of preliminary designs for headquarters-maintained assets, particularly concerning procurement and material management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国调中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Dispatching Center is responsible for organizing the preliminary design, review, and approval of projects related to directly maintained assets under its jurisdiction.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Finance Department participates in the review of preliminary designs, contributing to cost evaluation and financial oversight.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司分部安质处\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Company Branch Safety & Quality Office enforces company-wide preliminary design regulations, s