    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"技改项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category of projects involving technical renovation, where equipment replacement or upgrades are conducted, requiring specific documentation such as the 'Estimated Equipment Removal Appraisal Form' and compliance with asset disposal procedures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可研附件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A component of project feasibility studies that includes required documents like the 'Estimated Equipment Removal Appraisal Form' and must be consistent with other project records.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"拟拆除设备评估鉴定表\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A mandatory form to be submitted in the feasibility study attachment for projects involving asset removal, requiring accurate data on equipment origin, operation date, asset classification, coding, and justification for removal.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"拆旧物资清单\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A list detailing materials intended for removal and disposal, which must match the information in the 'Estimated Equipment Removal Appraisal Form'.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"大修项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A type of project focused on maintenance and repair without changing core components, such as anti-corrosion overhauls or pollution flashover coating, and which must not involve new fixed asset purchases.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"固定资产目录\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A financial reference document used to determine whether equipment or tools qualify as fixed assets, guiding procurement and accounting decisions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"PMS系统\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A project management system used for tracking project data, including project name, total investment amount, and other key metrics, which serves as a central source for validation of estimates and reports.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A formal document outlining cost projections for a project, required to include detailed tables, proper signatures, and alignment with project plans and PMS data.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"工程投资合计含税金额\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A financial 