ing scope, content, and scale, required to be signed and dated after the main contract but before the subcontract.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"承包合同\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The primary contract between a project owner and a contractor, defining terms, scope, payment, and responsibilities, which must precede any subcontract agreements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包合同\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A secondary agreement between a contractor and a subcontractor, required to align with the subcontract application, use standardized templates, and include clear payment and labor provisions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"风控平台截图\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A visual record from a risk control platform verifying workforce identity and alignment with subcontractor personnel, used for audit purposes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包结算\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A financial process ensuring subcontract payments do not exceed 50% of the total contractor settlement, with no advance payments beyond approved amounts.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"技改项目\"<|>\"拟拆除设备评估鉴定表\"<|>\"In tech renovation projects involving asset removal, the 'Estimated Equipment Removal Appraisal Form' must be submitted as part of the feasibility study attachments.\"|>\"asset disposal, documentation requirement\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"拟拆除设备评估鉴定表\"<|>\"拆旧物资清单\"<|>\"The equipment details in the appraisal form must exactly match those listed in the dismantled material inventory to ensure consistency and accuracy.\"|>\"data consistency, verification\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"大修项目\"<|>\"固定资产目录\"<|>\"Large overhaul projects must avoid purchasing new fixed assets; the definition of what constitutes a fixed asset is determined by the official 'Fixed Asset Directory'.\"|>\"procurement restriction, asset classification\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"估算书\"<|>\"PMS系统\"<|>\"The total investment amount in the estimate document must match the 'Total Investment (in ten thousand yuan)' field in the PMS system's project information page.\"|>\"data synchronization, system validation\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"96号文\"<|>\"预规\"<|>\"Both 96号文 and the pre-regulations provide authoritative guidance on cost calculation rules, especially regarding fees that may or may not be included in project estimates.\"|>\"regulatory framework, cost standards\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"返厂大修项目\"<|>\"其他费用\"<|>\"Service fees for returning equipment to the factory for repair must be categorized under 'other expenses' in the project budget.\"|>\"cost allocation, expense categorization\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"等保测评及安全防护费用\"<|>\"预规\"<|>\"According to pre-regulations, security assessment and protection costs must be included in the 'other expenses' section rather than being omitted.\"|>\"compliance, cost inclusion\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"三措一案\"<|>\"项目实施\"<|>\"All projects must provide 'three measures and one plan' documents, which are essential for project initiation and execution, especially for self-implemented projects.\"|>\"project readiness, procedural compliance\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"工作票\"<|>\"分包合同\"<|>\"Work tickets must be issued after the subcontract contract is signed, and their start time cannot precede the contract’s effective date.\"|>\"timing compliance, authorization sequence\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包申请表\"<|>\"承包合同\"<|>\"The subcontract application must be submitted after the main contract is signed and before the subcontract is finalized, ensuring proper procedural order.\"|>\"contract sequencing, approval process\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包合同\"<|>\"分包管理\"<|>\"Subcontracting must follow the rules defined in the 'subcontract management' framework, including limits on subcontracting percentage and prohibitions on further sub-subcontracting.\"|>\"governance, compliance enforcement\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包结算\"<|>\"分包合同\"<|>\"Subcontract settlement amounts must be based on the subcontract agreement and cannot exceed 50% of the total contractor settlement, ensuring financial integrity.\"|>\"payment 