ty, and service fees, excluding direct material and labor.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设备材料费\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The cost of procured equipment and materials, which must not be zero unless all equipment is reused, and includes software purchased for the project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"返厂服务费\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A fee charged for returning equipment to the manufacturer for repair, which must be included in the 'other expenses' section.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"技术支持的技术服务费\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Fees paid to manufacturers for on-site technical support during equipment repair, categorized under 'other expenses'.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"拆除费用\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Costs associated with dismantling equipment, which must align with the asset retirement disposal plan and not be charged if equipment is retained on-site.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书首页\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The first page of the cost estimate document, which must reflect accurate total amounts and serve as the primary source for system data entry.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"总表\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The summary table in the estimate document that aggregates all costs, required to match the total value in the PMS system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分表\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Detailed breakdown tables in the estimate document that support the total figure and must be consistent with the main table.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"资金重大调整\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Significant changes in project funding due to revised implementation plans, requiring re-submission of feasibility approval and plan adjustment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"当年投资变化超过15%\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A threshold for financial variation caused by procurement factors, triggering the need for plan adjustment even without re-reviewing feasibility.\")##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"249号文\"<|>\"分包管理\"<|>\"Document 249 provides the current legal framework for subcontracting practices, making it the authoritative guide for compliance.\"|>\"regulatory authority, compliance standard\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"74号文\"<|>\"分包管理\"<|>\"Document 74 has been repealed and should no longer be referenced in any subcontracting-related documentation or decisions.\"|>\"obsolescence, outdated regulation\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"主体工程\"<|>\"分包申请表\"<|>\"The scope of work in the subcontract application must exclude subject engineering tasks to avoid illegal subcontracting.\"|>\"prohibited subcontracting, scope restriction\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"关键性工程\"<|>\"承包合同\"<|>\"Contractual obligations prohibit the subcontracting of critical engineering work, ensuring control over core project elements.\"|>\"core task protection, contract integrity\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"施工费\"<|>\"结算原则\"<|>\"The construction fee is calculated as the audited construction cost multiplied by the discount ratio, forming the basis for final settlement.\"|>\"payment calculation, settlement basis\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"设计费\"<|>\"折扣比\"<|>\"Design fees must be adjusted using the same discount ratio applied to the overall contract, ensuring proportional reduction.\"|>\"fee adjustment, contractual consistency\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"监理费\"<|>\"折扣比\"<|>\"Supervision fees are subject to a discount coefficient (e.g., ×0.87), reflecting negotiated reductions in contract pricing.\"|>\"fee reduction, rate application\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"基本预备费\"<|>\"预规\"<|>\"According to pre-regulations, basic contingency funds are generally not allowed unless explicitly justified.\"|>\"cost exclusion, exception rule\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"招标费\"<|>\"预规\"<|>\"Pre-regulations state that tendering fees are not typically included, but may be counted if truly needed and properly documented.\"|>\"cost inclusion, justification required\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"后评价费\"<|>\"预规\"<|>\"Post-evaluation fees are generally not included, but can be included if substantiated with real evidence.\"|>\"cost inclusion, documentation required\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"高海拔、严寒、酷热特殊地区\"<|>\"96号文\"<|>\"These geog