    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Grid Company is a major state-owned enterprise responsible for the management and supervision of production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects. It establishes regulations, oversees implementation, and ensures compliance through designated departments such as the State Grid Operation and Maintenance Department.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Operation and Maintenance Department (referred to as 'Guo Wang Yun JIAN Bu') is responsible for interpreting and supervising the enforcement of the regulations related to project preliminary design and review management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技改和设备大修项目初设编制及评审管理流程\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The process outlines the steps for preparing and reviewing preliminary designs for production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects, including submission, contract signing, design execution, professional review, and evaluation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"附件一\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Attachment One is a diagram detailing the management flow for preliminary design compilation and review in production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"附件二\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Attachment Two provides detailed requirements for the depth of preliminary design content in production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects, covering various engineering aspects such as substation, overhead line, and cable projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"变电工程初设内容深度的具体要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This section specifies the required depth and content of preliminary design documents for substation projects, including general overview, power system, electrical components, civil works, environmental protection, and cost estimation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"架空线路工程初设内容深度的具体要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This section defines the detailed requirements for preliminary design of overhead line projects, including route planning, meteorological conditions, conductor selection, insulation coordination, grounding, and construction plans.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电缆工程初设内容深度的具体要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This section outlines the specific content depth requirements for cable project preliminary designs, covering route planning, cable selection, overvoltage protection, laying methods, and special environment handling.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"概算部分\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The budget section details the principles, basis, investment analysis, and preparation of cost estimates and supporting tables for project design.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第三十五条\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Article 35 establishes that the company will conduct spot checks on production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects, evaluating the quality of preliminary design and review work. Units failing to fulfill their responsibilities may be publicly criticized and included in performance evaluations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第三十六条\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Article 36 states that the State Grid Operation and Maintenance Department is responsible for interpreting and supervising the implementation of this regulation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第三十七条\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Article 37 specifies that this regulation took effect on August 1, 2014, and simultaneously revoked the previous version titled 'Management Measures for Preliminary Design Compilation and Review of Production Technology Renovation and Equipment Overhaul Projects (Trial)' issued under document Guo Dian Sheng [2010] No. 1761.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司输变电工程通用设备\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A standardized set of equipment used across power transmission and transformation projects, referenced in design specifications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司输变电工程通用造价\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A standard cost reference for power transmission and transformation projects used in budgeting and cost estimation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司输变电工程标准工艺\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Standardized construction techniques applied in power transmission and transformation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司标准化建设成果（输变电工程通用设备）应用目录\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A directory outlining the application of standardized construction achievements, particularly in the use of common equipment in power grid projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司“两型一化”变电站设计建设导则\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Guidelines for designing substations with characteristics of resource-conserving, environmentally friendly, and industrialized construction.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司电网工程限额设计控制指标\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Control indicators used to limit design costs and ensure economic efficiency in grid engineering projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司技术改造工程预算管理规定\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Regulations governing budget management for technical renovation projects within the State Grid system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司技术改造工程预算编制办法\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Methodology for preparing budgets in technical renovation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司电力工程装置性材料预算价格（2008年版）\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Budget price list for installation materials used in power engineering projects, published in 2008.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司电网工程建设预算编制与计算标准\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Standards for compiling and calculating construction budgets in power grid projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Q/GDW383-2009《智能变电站技术导则》及编制说明\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Technical guidelines and explanations for intelligent substation development, issued in 2009.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Q/GDW394-2009《110（66）kV～220kV智能变电站技术导则》及编制说明\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Technical guidelines for intelligent substations operating at voltage levels of 110 (66) kV to 220 kV, along with explanatory notes.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"The State Grid Operation and Maintenance Department is subordinate to the National Grid Company and is tasked with interpreting and enforcing its regulations.\"<|>\"organizational hierarchy, regulatory oversight\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"生产技改和设备大修项目初设编制及评审管理流程\"<|>\"The management process is est