    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Grid Company is a major state-owned power company in China responsible for the management and supervision of production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects. It established and issued regulations regarding the preliminary design compilation and review management process, including the 'Production Technology Renovation and Equipment Overhaul Project Preliminary Design Compilation and Review Management Process' and related depth specifications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Operation and Maintenance Department (Guodian Yunjianbu) is responsible for interpreting and supervising the implementation of the regulations related to production technology renovation and equipment overhaul project management, as specified in Article 36.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技改大修项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects refer to engineering initiatives involving upgrades and repairs to existing power infrastructure, governed by specific technical and procedural standards set by the National Grid Company.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"初设编制及评审管理流程\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The preliminary design compilation and review management process is a structured workflow involving multiple stages such as submission of design requirements, contract signing, design execution, professional review, and evaluation, implemented across various levels of the organization including provincial, municipal, and county-level power companies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设计单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Design units are entities contracted to carry out preliminary design work based on project requirements, tasked with gathering materials, fulfilling contractual obligations, and producing design documents compliant with specified standards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Project units are responsible for organizing the signing of design contracts, coordina