sed for financial planning and decision-making.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可行性研究估算投资\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Feasibility study investment estimate is the initial projected cost of the project based on preliminary data and assumptions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"增减原因分析\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Analysis of reasons for cost increases or decreases between feasibility study estimates and preliminary design estimates, used to justify budget adjustments.\")##\n\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力电缆\"<|>\"通信电缆\"<|>\"Power cables pose potential danger to nearby communication cables, necessitating protective measures to prevent interference or damage.\"<|>\"hazard mitigation, electromagnetic interference\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"通信光缆\"<|>\"隧道、沟道、电缆夹层、工作井\"<|>\"Optical cables are installed within tunnels, ducts, cable trays, and work wells, with defined placement and installation methods.\"<|>\"installation location, infrastructure integration\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电缆通道\"<|>\"横断面设计\"<|>\"The cross-sectional design defines the dimensions and structural features of the cable channel, such as width, height, and material thickness.\"<|>\"design specification, spatial planning\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电缆通道\"<|>\"纵断面设计\"<|>\"The longitudinal profile design determines the slope and burial depth of the cable channel based on terrain and planning requirements.\"<|>\"geometric layout, topographic adaptation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电缆通道\"<|>\"防水设计\"<|>\"Waterproofing is integrated into the channel structure and joint areas to prevent moisture infiltration.\"<|>\"structural integrity, environmental protection\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电缆通道\"<|>\"防火设计\"<|>\"Fire protection measures such as fire barriers and monitoring systems are incorporated into the channel design.\"<|>\"safety compliance, risk prevention\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电缆通道\"<|>\"通风设计\"<|>\"Ventilation systems are included in channels intended for personnel access to maintain safe air quality.\"<|>\"occupational safety, environmental control\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电缆通道\"<|>\"照明设计\"<|>\"Lighting is installed in personnel-accessible channels to ensure visibility and operational safety.\"<|>\"visibility, safety standard\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"工作井\"<|>\"电缆通道\"<|>\"Work wells are integral parts of the cable channel system, used for access, maintenance, and cable routing.\"<|>\"infrastructure component, access point\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电缆终端站\"<|>\"电缆通道\"<|>\"The cable terminal station connects the cable channel to the broader power grid and requires alignment with channel design.\"<|>\"system integration, interface point\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电缆登杆（塔）\"<|>\"电缆通道\"<|>\"Cable ladders (poles/towers) serve as transition points between cable channels and overhead lines.\"<|>\"transition structure, connectivity\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"特殊环境段\"<|>\"敷设方式\"<|>\"Special environments such as high drops and underwater sections require modified or specialized cable installation methods.\"<|>\"adaptation, technical modification\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"特殊环境段\"<|>\"支撑与固定方式\"<|>\"In challenging environments, cable support and fixation must be reinforced to handle stress and environmental loads.\"<|>\"mechanical stability, environmental resilience\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"主要设备材料清册\"<|>\"电缆线路本体部分\"<|>\"The main equipment list includes all physical components of the cable system, such as cables, accessories, and supports.\"<|>\"inventory, procurement planning\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"概算部分\"<|>\"电网技术改造工程预算定额\"<|>\"The budget section relies on official standards like the 'Grid Technology Renovation Engineering Budget Quota' for cost estimation.\"<|>\"cost estimation, regulatory framework\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"初设概算\"<|>\"可行性研究估算投资\"<|>\"The preliminary design estimate is compared to the feasibility study investment forecast to analyze cost variances.\"<|>\"financial comparison, budget validation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship