age is a critical factor in design, especially for bends in tunnels or work wells.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电缆转弯半径要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Requirements for cable turning radius ensure that cables are not damaged during installation and operation, particularly in tight spaces.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"软弱或特殊地基\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Weak or special soil conditions require special foundation treatment, such as reinforcement or deep piling, to support structures like work wells and terminal stations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"抗震设防等级\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Seismic resistance level defines the degree of earthquake protection required for structures such as cable terminal stations, based on regional seismic risk.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"抗震构造措施\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Structural measures taken to enhance resistance to earthquakes, including reinforcement techniques and design standards for buildings and foundations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"基础型式及埋深\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Foundation type and depth refer to the structural base design and how deep it extends into the ground, depending on soil conditions and load requirements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"内场地处理方案\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Internal site handling plan refers to the preparation and finishing of internal surfaces within a cable terminal station for functional use.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"混凝土标号\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Concrete grade specifies the strength and quality of concrete used in construction, affecting durability and load-bearing capacity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"钢材型号\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Steel type refers to the specific grade and form of steel materials used in structural components, influencing strength and corrosion resistance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"保护管材质\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Material type of protective pipes includes plastic, metal, or composite materials, selected based on durability, cost, and environmental conditions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电缆附件\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Cable accessories include devices such as joints, terminations, and clamps 