ables, insulators, fittings, steel, cement, wood, and other professional materials, with details on quantity, specifications, and inclusion of tools or spare parts.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"主要拆除设备清单及处置意见\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category contains a list of equipment to be removed during the renovation and provides recommendations for their disposal.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.1\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.1 corresponds to the '总论部分' of the overhead line engineering preliminary design, outlining design basis, project context, and scope.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.2\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.2 covers the '电力系统' aspect of overhead line engineering, focusing on system role, outage planning, and coordination with protection and communication systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.3\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.3 details the '线路路径' planning for overhead lines, including geographical and environmental factors, alignment, and transition strategies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.4\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.4 specifies the '气象条件' used in the design, including special case analysis and justification for meteorological parameters.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.5\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.5 addresses the '导线和地线选择' based on system capacity and operational conditions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.6\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.6 focuses on '绝缘配合', determining insulation levels and air gap requirements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.7\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.7 deals with '防雷与接地' design, including lightning protection and grounding system specifications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.8\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.8 discusses '防振措施' based on tension and operational demands.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.9.1\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.9.1 covers '杆塔型式' selection and evaluation criteria, including use of existing or new towers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.9.2\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.9.2 provides the '地质概况' based on geological surveys along the route.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.9.3\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.9.3 addresses '基础型式' selection considering geological and logistical conditions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.10\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.10 outlines '交叉跨越' control standards and handling principles.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.11\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.11 presents '存在问题及建议' regarding technical and coordination challenges.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.12\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.12 details '停电方案设计' for the renovation project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.13\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.13 reiterates '施工图卷册安排' for the construction drawing phase.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"5.14\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 5.14 defines the contents of the '主要设备材料清册' including materials, quantities, and additional considerations like tools and losses.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"6.1\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 6.1 corresponds to the '总论部分' of the cable engineering preliminary design.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"6.2\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 6.2 covers the '电力系统' aspect for cable projects, including outage impact and system integration.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"6.3\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 6.3 details the '线路路径' for cable projects, including alignment, environmental factors, and visual documentation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"6.4\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 6.4 specifies '气象条件与土壤特性' relevant to cable installation and thermal performance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"6.5\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 6.5 addresses '电力电缆及其附件的选型' based on load, environment, and reliability requirements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"6.6\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Section 6.6 covers '过电压保护、接地、分段和通信干扰' including protection strategies and grounding practices.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"改造实施步骤\"<|>\"施工图卷册安排\"<|>\"The '施工图卷册安排' is a component of the overall '改造实施步骤', detailing document organization during the construction phase.\"<|>\"project planning, documentation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"改造实施步骤\"<|>\"主要设备材料清册\"<|>\"The '主要设备材料清册' is a critical part of the '改造实施步骤', providing essential material lists for execution.\"<|>\