    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Grid Company is a major organization responsible for managing and overseeing production technology transformation and equipment overhaul projects in China. It establishes regulations, provides guidelines for design depth, and supervises implementation through its departments such as the State Grid Operation & Maintenance Department.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Operation & Maintenance Department is responsible for interpreting and supervising the execution of the regulations related to production technology transformation and equipment overhaul project management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技改和设备大修项目初设编制及评审管理流程\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The process outlines the steps for preparing and reviewing preliminary designs for production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects, including submission, contract signing, design execution, review, and evaluation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"附件一\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Attachment One is a document detailing the management flowchart for the preliminary design preparation and review process of production technology transformation and equipment overhaul projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"附件二\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Attachment Two is a document specifying the depth requirements for preliminary design compilation in production technology transformation and equipment overhaul projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"变电工程初设内容深度的具体要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This section specifies detailed content and depth requirements for preliminary design documents in substation engineering projects, covering areas such as power systems, electrical components, insulation coordination, and environmental considerations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"架空线路工程初设内容深度的具体要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This section details the specific content and depth standards for preliminary design documents in overhead line engineering projects, including route planning, meteorological conditions, conducto