    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A categorized list of issues identified during the review of project specifications, organized by thematic areas such as basic information, equipment association, decommissioned materials, and feasibility study quality.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"基本信息\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Category covering issues related to fundamental project details including approval status, necessity justification, naming conventions, voltage level accuracy, and project classification.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"改造对象关联不足或错误\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Category addressing problems in linking projects to their intended equipment or infrastructure for renovation or maintenance, including incomplete or inaccurate associations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"拆旧物资信息不规范\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Category focused on inconsistencies and inaccuracies in documentation regarding decommissioned materials, including missing, incorrect, or improperly recorded data.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可行性研究报告\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Category detailing deficiencies in the preparation, content, completeness, and authenticity of feasibility study reports and supporting documents.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未专业审核\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where project requirements were not reviewed by qualified professionals prior to implementation, leading to potential technical and procedural risks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设备缺陷定性描述\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event involving the lack of quantitative evidence (e.g., test data, operational records) to support claims about equipment defects, resulting in weak justifications for project necessity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目名称不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where project names fail to include key identifiers such as provincial units or whether the project is a technical upgrade or major overhaul.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"大修挂接设备错误\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where major repair projects are incorrectly linked to equipment, specifically failing to associate with correct tower structures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未挂接可研批复\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event in which a project lacks formal linkage to its approved feasibility study, undermining project legitimacy and planning integrity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目前期工作准备不足\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event indicating that projects were included in pre-arrangements without proper inclusion in a reserve database or completion of feasibility reviews and approvals.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急项目无备案表\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where emergency projects lack required documentation such as backup forms or confirmation letters, violating compliance protocols.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"原计划调整超限未重新审批\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where project scope increases by more than 15% without undergoing re-evaluation and re-approval of the feasibility study.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目投资不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the total project cost differs from the approved budget, creating financial discrepancies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设备主材料信息维护不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event involving inconsistent or incorrect recording of main equipment materials in system databases, including mismatches between system entries and actual quantities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"方案规模不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the projected scale of a project does not match documented data such as feasibility study estimates or material lists.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"规模成效配置不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the reported scale and effectiveness metrics exceed the total investment amount or contain incomplete/inconsistent data.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"预规版本不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the preliminary budget version used in the system conflicts with the official project proposal or lacks required project scoring.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"立项依据选取错误\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the justification for project initiation is based on irrelevant or incorrect criteria, such as using circuit breaker upgrade references for a transmission line project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"技改与零购项目边界不清\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where distinctions between technical renovation and minor procurement projects are blurred, leading to misclassification.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"专业分类填写不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where project categorization fails to reflect true technical nature, such as classifying protection upgrades under 'primary power grid' instead of 'secondary systems'.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未关联改造/大修对象\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where no equipment or infrastructure is linked to a project intended for renovation or major repair.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"改造对象关联不完整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where only a partial set of intended equipment is associated with the project, such as linking fewer than the total number of targeted distribution areas.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"改造对象关联不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the system links incorrect or incomplete equipment information to a project, such as omitting key devices like the 'Guangdong Zhejiang Jinhua Distribution Network Dispatch Backup System'.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"关联改造对象信息不全\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where essential details such as device names are missing from the linked equipment information.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"拆旧物资填写不完整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where decommissioned material data is incomplete, such as reporting fewer items removed than actually replaced.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"不涉及拆旧项目维护拆旧信息\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where projects that do not involve dismantling still have decommissioning data entered, creating false records.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"涉及拆旧项目未维护拆旧信息\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where projects that require equipment removal fail to record any decommissioning details in the system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"拆旧物资数量不全\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the number of decommissioned items listed is less than the actual quantity removed, e.g., 12 out of 13 transformers logged.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"拆旧项目必填项信息维护不全\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where mandatory fields such as asset attributes, expected removal count, disposal method, and