    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A categorized list of issues found in project estimation documents, including incomplete signatures, improper cost calculations, outdated pre-regulations, and inconsistent data across tables.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A categorized list of issues related to the preparation, content, and approval of project feasibility reports, including missing documentation, inconsistent investment figures, and invalid or expired review documents.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：7\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A categorized list of problems concerning pre-arranged plans, key supervised projects, and project adjustments, including weak justification for pre-planning, duplicate planning entries, and insufficient rationale for reductions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：8\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A categorized list of issues related to project contracts, including incomplete signing, incorrect dates, missing contracts, non-compliant changes, and improper contract types.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书签字页校核人员签章不全\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the verification personnel's seals are missing on the estimation document signature page, such as the absence of a cost certification stamp or an expired qualification seal.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书费用计取不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event involving improper inclusion or exclusion of costs in the estimation document, such as listing precision air conditioners, video surveillance, and cables as client-provided (乙供) items, or including loan interest in the other expenses table.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未使用最新预规版本\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event indicating that outdated pre-regulation versions (e.g., 2015 edition) were used instead of the required current version (2020 edition).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书编制内容错误\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the sum of individual cost items does not equal the total engineering investment amount, indicating calculation errors in the document.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"取费依据不足\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where no supporting documentation is provided for cost calculation bases, leading to lack of verifiability.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"整体造价不合理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where project costs are disproportionately high compared to similar projects, such as higher investment per substation or per equipment unit.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书内容不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where material prices vary inconsistently within the same document, indicating inaccuracies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书甲/乙供物资计列不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the estimation lists materials as client-provided (乙供), but internal material requisition records show they are actually company-provided (甲供).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"其他费用与实际发生偏差较大\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where actual expenses for other costs are only 36% of the estimated value due to changes in implementation plan, with no timely adjustment made.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书定额套用不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where incorrect construction quotas were applied, such as using 'substation and switch station installation' rather than 'overhead line engineering' for a power line project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目估算书与项目可研报告不一致\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the number of transformers listed for replacement differs between the estimation document (4 units) and the project proposal (12 units).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目估算书内容不完整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a cost item (e.g., demolition work) appears in the summary table but lacks corresponding detail in the specific form.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"部分费用重复计列\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where demolition work was counted twice: once in cable replacement and again separately in the demolition section.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书编制依据不合理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the estimation document fails to follow updated pre-regulations, quotas, information prices, or price differences during the compilation period.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书各表金额计列不一致\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the amounts listed across different forms do not match, such as discrepancies between total and detailed tables.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"费用计列不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event involving inaccurate cost listings—either including non-existent expenses or omitting real ones—and lack of detailed breakdowns for lump-sum charges.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书不规范，仅有总表，无明细表\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the estimation document contains only a summary table without any detailed supporting tables.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书总表与明细表不一致\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the total cost in the summary table (145.84 million) differs from the amount in the detailed table (129.27 million).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书存在不应计列的费用\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where disallowed costs, such as bidding fees, are included in the estimation document.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书与项目名称不对应\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the estimation document’s title or reference does not align with the actual project name.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书资料上传错误\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the uploaded file is incorrectly labeled—for example, submitting a budget document instead of an estimation document.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书与可研报告金额不一致\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the estimation document shows a value of 910,000 yuan while the feasibility report states 850,000 yuan.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目估算书中工程概况未进行描述\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the engineering overview section in the estimation document is blank or missing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目估算书扫描件不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where scanned signature pages lack cost certification stamps, electronic versions lack personnel details, or the cover lacks a date.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未按规定编制可研报告\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the feasibility study report was not prepared according to required standards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可研报告内容不完整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the feasibility report lacks proper signatures, seals, or has conflicting project justifications between the report and the PMS system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可研报告中投资金额与PMS中基本信息不一致\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the investment amount recorded in the feasibility report does not match the amount in the PMS system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目建议书信息不准确或缺失\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the project proposal claims no demolition work, but the PMS system indicates multiple devices are scheduled for removal.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未提供计划调整文件\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a project underwent a significant change in budget (from 328,700 yuan to 259,300 yuan, over 20% reduction) without reapproval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研文件逻辑错误\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the timeline is illogical—e.g., a preliminary estimate was prepared in August 2022, but the feasibility study review was completed in May 2022.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"厂家技术服务费询价不规范、费用偏高\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where technical service fees from vendors were not properly quoted and are considered excessively high.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"汽车、人工运输、青赔费用等计取缺乏依据\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where transportation and green compensation costs were calculated without supporting evidence such as route maps or standard documents.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"措施费计取不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where measures like night work fees and repeated site access fees were incorrectly included.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"其他费用计取不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where management funds and bidding fees were improperly included in other costs.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"估算书编制依据不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the estimation document failed to state the project overview, basis, or principles, or did not use updated pre-regulations, quotas, or pricing benchmarks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目估算金额编制有误\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the total in the summary table does not match the sum of detailed tables—for example, inconsistency between Table 1 and Table 2.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目费用计列不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event involving overstatement of costs (like bidding fees or management expenses) or lack of supporting details for lump-sum charges.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可研评审意见及批复文件挂接错误\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the attached review or approval document does not contain the correct project information.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研与批复金额不一致\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the review opinion stated a total investment of 1,351.06 million yuan, but the basic information listed 1,396.49 million yuan, creating a discrepancy of 45.43 million yuan.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可研评审意见及批复文件超3年\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the review opinion was issued in 2018 or 2021, exceeding the 3-year validity period, requiring re-review.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可研评审意见未挂接\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the feasibility study review opinion was not linked to the project record.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研批复未挂接\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the formal approval document was not associated with the project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可研评审或批复文件缺失\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where necessary review or approval documents were not obtained in time.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可研批复未附项目清单\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the approved document lacks a detailed list of included projects, making it hard to verify alignment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研编审批方面其他问题\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where required attachments, such as the main equipment and material list, were not uploaded in the project proposal.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"预安排计划必要性不强\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where non-critical or non-urgent projects (e.g., testing platforms, auxiliary facility maintenance) were included in pre-arranged plans.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"预安排原因不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the reason for pre-arrangement was incorrectly filled—for example, labeling a routine overhaul as a 'peak load season demand' project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"2023年调整与2024年预安排重复计列\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a project already listed in the 2024 pre-arranged plan was again adjusted, causing double counting.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"重点督办/预安排项目调减依据不充分\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a reduction in a key supervised or pre-arranged project lacked professional consensus or supporting documents.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调整原因不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the reason for adjusting the project budget (e.g., citing large fund surplus) is unclear or misstated.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资采购结余较多，未及时调整计划\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the actual procurement cost for company-provided materials was lower than the estimated cost, but the project investment was not revised accordingly.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目合同签字/盖章不完整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where project contracts lack essential elements such as covers, or both parties’ signatures and dates are missing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目合同签订日期不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where design and supervision contracts were signed before the official project issuance date.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未提供项目监理/施工/设计等合同\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where critical contracts (e.g., for supervision, construction, or design) were not submitted.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目变更手续不齐全\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a project’s settlement amount exceeds the original contract amount without a supplementary agreement.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目施工合同签订不合理\"<|>\"An event where a fully self-implemented project still entered into a maintenance contract with a third party, lacking bidding notice or other legal basis.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目设计合同金额大于估算书金额\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the design contract amount (47,000 yuan) exceeded the estimated design fee (46,500 yuan).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目合同签订日期超30日\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a project’s supervision contract was signed 53 days after the bid award notice, violating the 30-day rule.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同签订不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the final contract type (e.g., rate-based) contradicts the awarded contract type (e.g., lump-sum).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自主实施项目归档不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a self-implemented project lacks a formal self-execution statement in its documentation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目合同无实质性内容\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the contract contains no meaningful terms or obligations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同签订与中标通知书不一致\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the contract specifies a lump-sum model while the bid notice specifies a rate-based model.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"施工合同签订时间早于中标通知书时间\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the construction contract was signed on March 10, 2023, but the bid notice was issued on April 26, 2023.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"无三措一案\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the required 'three measures and one plan' (safety, technical, organizational measures, and construction plan) were missing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自主实施项目疑似外包实施\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a self-implemented project’s records (e.g., start/end reports, settlement files) indicate external contractors performed the work, raising concerns about actual outsourcing.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书签字页校核人员签章不全\"<|>\"The issue of incomplete signatures and seals is part of the broader category of estimation document flaws identified in review table 5.\"<|>\"document compliance, verification oversight\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书费用计取不规范\"<|>\"Improper cost allocation is a core issue highlighted in table 5, reflecting systemic flaws in estimation practices.\"<|>\"cost accuracy, financial compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"未使用最新预规版本\"<|>\"Using outdated pre-regulations is a recurring flaw documented in table 5, indicating failure to follow current standards.\"<|>\"regulatory compliance, document updates\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书编制内容错误\"<|>\"Calculation errors in the estimation document are directly reported in table 5, showing inconsistencies in cost summation.\"<|>\"data integrity, calculation error\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"取费依据不足\"<|>\"Lack of supporting documentation for cost calculation is explicitly listed in table 5.\"<|>\"documentation, cost justification\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"整体造价不合理\"<|>\"Disproportionate project costs relative to benchmarks are flagged in table 5.\"<|>\"cost benchmarking, economic efficiency\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书内容不准确\"<|>\"Inconsistent material pricing is a direct example of inaccuracy noted in table 5.\"<|>\"data consistency, pricing accuracy\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书甲/乙供物资计列不规范\"<|>\"Mismatch between estimated supply status and actual procurement records is a major concern in table 5.\"<|>\"supply classification, data validation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"其他费用与实际发生偏差较大\"<|>\"Significant deviation between estimated and actual other costs is a critical finding in table 5.\"<|>\"cost forecasting, variance analysis\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书定额套用不准确\"<|>\"Incorrect quota application is a serious technical error detailed in table 5.\"<|>\"technical accuracy, standard compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"项目估算书与项目可研报告不一致\"<|>\"Discrepancy between estimation and feasibility study is a key issue in table 5.\"<|>\"document alignment, cross-reference integrity\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"项目估算书内容不完整\"<|>\"Missing details in supporting forms despite presence in summary tables is a documented flaw in table 5.\"<|>\"completeness, data traceability\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"部分费用重复计列\"<|>\"Redundant cost entries are explicitly mentioned in table 5.\"<|>\"cost duplication, financial integrity\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书编制依据不合理\"<|>\"Failure to apply current regulations and benchmarks is a structural issue in table 5.\"<|>\"methodological compliance, documentation rigor\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书各表金额计列不一致\"<|>\"Amount mismatches across tables are directly reported in table 5.\"<|>\"data consistency, reconciliation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"费用计列不规范\"<|>\"General cost listing errors, including omissions and inclusions, are central to table 5.\"<|>\"cost control, procedural correctness\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书不规范，仅有总表，无明细表\"<|>\"Lack of detailed tables is a fundamental structural flaw in table 5.\"<|>\"document completeness, transparency\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书总表与明细表不一致\"<|>\"Summation errors between summary and detailed tables are a primary issue in table 5.\"<|>\"data reconciliation, numerical accuracy\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书存在不应计列的费用\"<|>\"Including disallowed charges is a clear violation in table 5.\"<|>\"financial ethics, cost legitimacy\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书与项目名称不对应\"<|>\"Mismatch between document title and project name is a minor but notable issue in table 5.\"<|>\"metadata accuracy, identification\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书资料上传错误\"<|>\"Incorrect file uploads are a procedural mistake documented in table 5.\"<|>\"file management, data integrity\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"估算书与可研报告金额不一致\"<|>\"Differences in estimated vs. feasibility study values are a major inconsistency in table 5.\"<|>\"cross-document consistency, financial alignment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"项目估算书中工程概况未进行描述\"<|>\"Missing descriptions in the engineering overview are a content gap in table 5.\"<|>\"content completeness, documentation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：5\"<|>\"项目估算书扫描件不规范\"<|>\"Poor-quality or incomplete scans violate document standards in table 5.\"<|>\"document quality, digital compliance\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"未按规定编制可研报告\"<|>\"Failure to follow standard procedures for feasibility studies is a foundational issue in table 6.\"<|>\"procedural compliance, documentation standards\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"可研报告内容不完整\"<|>\"Missing signatures, seals, and inconsistent justifications are serious gaps in table 6.\"<|>\"document completeness, verification\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"可研报告中投资金额与PMS中基本信息不一致\"<|>\"Mismatch between report and PMS data is a systemic data issue in table 6.\"<|>\"data synchronization, system integration\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"项目建议书信息不准确或缺失\"<|>\"Contradictions between project proposal and PMS data are critical in table 6.\"<|>\"data consistency, truthfulness\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"未提供计划调整文件\"<|>\"Failure to submit adjustment documents for major budget changes is a procedural lapse in table 6.\"<|>\"change management, governance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"项目可研文件逻辑错误\"<|>\"Illogical timelines (e.g., review before preparation) indicate serious flaws in table 6.\"<|>\"temporal logic, document coherence\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"厂家技术服务费询价不规范、费用偏高\"<|>\"Unverified high-cost services are a financial risk in table 6.\"<|>\"procurement fairness, cost control\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"汽车、人工运输、青赔费用等计取缺乏依据\"<|>\"Lack of supporting evidence for transportation and compensation costs is a compliance issue in table 6.\"<|>\"justification, documentation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"措施费计取不规范\"<|>\"Improper inclusion of special fees (e.g., night work) violates standard practice in table 6.\"<|>\"fee rationality, cost justification\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"其他费用计取不规范\"<|>\"Misapplication of management and bidding fees is a common flaw in table 6.\"<|>\"expense categorization, financial discipline\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目规范审查问题一览表：6\"<|>\"估算书编制依据不规范\"<|>\"Failure to cite updated standards is a methodological error in table 6.\"<|>\"standard adherence, documentation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relat