stem records.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"以估算代替结算\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement report replicates the content and amount of the estimate without actual adjustments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目结算报告中物资甲供转乙供\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where materials initially designated as government-provided (甲供) are reclassified as privately sourced (乙供) in the settlement, raising accountability concerns.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"结算报告中单项费用与估算差别较大\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where individual cost categories differ significantly from initial estimates without justification.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"结算时间早于竣工时间、间偏差较大\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement date precedes the official completion date by a significant margin, violating procedural order.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"以概算代替结算\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement report mirrors the content and figure of the preliminary budget without updates.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"施工结算时间远晚于竣工时间\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement occurs months after project completion, failing contractual obligations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目结算不及时\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement remains pending long after project completion, with no updated documents submitted.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"决算材料不完整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where essential final accounting documents such as the final settlement statement and audit report are missing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目拆分立项\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a single project is artificially split into multiple smaller ones to circumvent planning or oversight rules.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目工期安排不合理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the project schedule is too tight due to late initiation, making execution difficult and recommending cross-year implementation.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"承包管理方面\"<|>\"承包合同问题\"<|>\"The category '承包管理方面' encompasses core issues related to contract signing and validity, including those explicitly listed under '承包合同问题', such as missing amounts, lack of signatures, a