    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"承包管理方面\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category referring to issues related to the management of contracting processes, including contract signing, template usage, and financial clarity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"承包合同问题\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category encompassing deficiencies in construction contracts such as missing amounts, lack of signatures or dates, incorrect dates, non-uniform templates, and amounts exceeding project investment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"承载力承诺书问题\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category addressing issues with capacity commitment letters, including failure to sign, missing seals or dates, and incorrect timing relative to other documents.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包管理方面\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category covering problems in subcontracting management, such as unauthorized or untimely approvals, unclear scope, excessive subcontracting percentages, and improper documentation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包申请问题\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category detailing flaws in subcontracting application procedures, including missing applications, invalid dates, lack of approval from relevant units, and inconsistent or incomplete information.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包合同问题\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category highlighting discrepancies and deficiencies in subcontracting contracts, such as mismatched amounts, missing signatures/dates, illegal dates, inconsistent work content, and excessive subcontracting.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"工作票管理问题\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category focusing on irregularities in work ticket administration, including mismatched entities, prior issuance than contracts, missing tickets, unauthorized personnel, and premature involvement of subcontractors.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包单位人员管理问题\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category concerning inconsistencies in personnel management for subcontracting units, such as mismatched records between work tickets and risk control platforms, missing data, and incomplete system information.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工验收方面\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category addressing shortcomings in final acceptance procedures, including incomplete material handover, missing construction documents, improper handling of old equipment removal, inaccurate or missing reports, and logical inconsistencies in dates.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目结（决）算方面\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category outlining issues in project settlement and final accounting, including incomplete materials, outdated certification stamps, inconsistent amounts, late submissions, incorrect cost allocations, and use of estimates instead of actuals.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"其它\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A miscellaneous category covering additional issues not classified elsewhere, such as project splitting and unreasonable scheduling.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未明确合同金额\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the contract amount is not specified, particularly in cases of bundled projects without individual pricing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同未签章、无签订日期\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event involving the absence of signature or date on a contract, specifically observed on cover and signature pages.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同计划开竣工日期有误\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the planned completion date precedes the planned start date, indicating a logical error in scheduling.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同未使用统一模板\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a non-standard document (e.g., construction commission letter) is used instead of the official unified construction contract template.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同金额不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the contract value exceeds the total project investment, violating financial norms.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未签订承载力承诺书\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the capacity commitment letter was not executed at all.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"承载力承诺书未盖章或无签订日期\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the capacity commitment letter lacks required seals or a valid signing date.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"承诺书时间填写错误\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the signing date of the commitment letter is incorrectly recorded, such as being one year earlier than the contractor agreement.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未签订分包申请表\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the subcontracting application form was not formally signed or submitted.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包申请表时间不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the approval date of the subcontracting application precedes the main contract signing date, indicating procedural reversal.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包申请表未经项目单位审批\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the subcontracting application was approved without formal endorsement from the project unit.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包申请表金额不明确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the subcontracting application lacks a defined amount, leading to ambiguity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包内容不明确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the scope of subcontracted work is not clearly described in the application.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"拟分包金额超过承包合同金额 50%\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the proposed subcontracting portion exceeds half of the total contract value, raising concerns about dependency and oversight.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包申请表无签订日期\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the subcontracting application form lacks a documented signing date.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包申请日期晚于分包合同\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the approval date of the subcontracting application comes after the contract’s signing date, indicating reverse procedure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包审批表包含多个项目分包申请\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where multiple distinct projects are consolidated into a single subcontracting application, violating separation requirements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包申请表未经监理单位审批\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the subcontracting application failed to receive approval from the supervising unit despite meeting threshold criteria.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包申请表未经业主单位审批\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the owner’s unit did not approve or stamp the subcontracting application, leaving it unverified.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包合同金额和分包审批表报审金额不一致\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the reported subcontracting amount differs from the actual contract amount, creating financial inconsistency.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包合同未签章、无签订日期\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the subcontracting contract lacks proper signatures and a valid signing date.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包合同金额超过承包合同金额 50%\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the subcontracting contract value surpasses 50% of the primary contract, potentially indicating excessive delegation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包合同未明确合同金额\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the subcontracting contract fails to specify a price clause, causing ambiguity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包合同时间早于主合同时间\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the subcontracting contract was signed before the main contract, violating logical sequence.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包合同的施工工程量与分包申请内容不一致\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the actual work scope in the contract differs from what was applied for, suggesting misalignment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"劳务分包合同工作内容与承包合同雷同\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the labor subcontracting work description closely matches that of the main contract, indicating potential overlap or misuse.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"工作票中作业单位与分包单位不对应\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the entity listed on the work ticket does not match the actual subcontractor involved.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"工作票时间早于合同签订时间\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the work ticket was issued before the contract was signed, indicating procedural violation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"已开工项目未提供工作票\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a project already in progress has no associated work tickets, failing compliance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"工作票上的施工单位非承包单位，也非分包单位\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where an external entity appears on the work ticket without formal subcontracting agreements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分包单位人员在分包合同签订前加入工作\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where subcontractor personnel participated in work prior to the formal signing of their contract, indicating pre-employment activity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"提供的风控平台信息与工作票不匹配\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the responsible person listed in the risk control platform differs from that on the work ticket.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"未提供风控平台人员信息\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where critical personnel data from the risk control platform is missing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目风控系统提供信息不全\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the risk control system only includes basic personnel details but lacks complete job plans or verification screenshots.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资到货验收手续不齐全\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where essential documentation like material lists and handover records are missing during material receipt.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目施工资料不完整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where key construction documents such as supervision records, engineering quantity details, and completion reports are absent.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"拆旧物资手续不齐全\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where documentation for dismantled or retired materials is missing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"开工报告提供不准确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the submitted document is mislabeled (e.g., uploading a report instead of an actual report), lacking specific construction descriptions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"资料归档不完整、不正确\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where project files are improperly archived, such as marking a project as self-executed while reports are issued by external parties.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工投运报告工程量与审定结算书中计列工程量不符\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the volume of work reported in the commissioning report differs significantly from that in the approved settlement.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"开工报告与竣工报告日期逻辑关系不符\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the start date in the start-up report is later than the end date in the completion report, indicating contradiction.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工验收报告资料提供不规范\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the submitted document is not the correct type (e.g., using a three-level acceptance form instead of a formal acceptance report).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"结算报告造价人员资质章过期\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the professional certification seal 