stem records.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"以估算代替结算\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement report replicates the content and amount of the estimate without actual adjustments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目结算报告中物资甲供转乙供\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where materials initially designated as government-provided (甲供) are reclassified as privately sourced (乙供) in the settlement, raising accountability concerns.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"结算报告中单项费用与估算差别较大\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where individual cost categories differ significantly from initial estimates without justification.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"结算时间早于竣工时间、间偏差较大\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement date precedes the official completion date by a significant margin, violating procedural order.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"以概算代替结算\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement report mirrors the content and figure of the preliminary budget without updates.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"施工结算时间远晚于竣工时间\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement occurs months after project completion, failing contractual obligations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目结算不及时\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the settlement remains pending long after project completion, with no updated documents submitted.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"决算材料不完整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where essential final accounting documents such as the final settlement statement and audit report are missing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目拆分立项\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where a single project is artificially split into multiple smaller ones to circumvent planning or oversight rules.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目工期安排不合理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An event where the project schedule is too tight due to late initiation, making execution difficult and recommending cross-year implementation.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"承包管理方面\"<|>\"承包合同问题\"<|>\"The category '承包管理方面' encompasses core issues related to contract signing and validity, including those explicitly listed under '承包合同问题', such as missing amounts, lack of signatures, and incorrect dates.\"<|>\"contract management, procedural compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"承包管理方面\"<|>\"承载力承诺书问题\"<|>\"Both '承包管理方面' and '承载力承诺书问题' fall under broader contract and compliance management, with the latter focusing specifically on commitment documents tied to capacity.\"<|>\"document compliance, contractual obligations\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包管理方面\"<|>\"分包申请问题\"<|>\"The '分包管理方面' category includes all procedural failures related to subcontracting applications, such as missing approvals, invalid dates, and lack of clear scope.\"<|>\"subcontracting governance, approval workflow\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包管理方面\"<|>\"分包合同问题\"<|>\"Issues in '分包合同问题' stem directly from poor management practices outlined in '分包管理方面', including mismatched amounts, early dates, and lack of clarity.\"<|>\"contract integrity, procedural consistency\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包申请问题\"<|>\"分包合同问题\"<|>\"Discrepancies in the '分包合同' often originate from flawed '分包申请' forms, such as inconsistent amounts, unapproved applications, and backward dates.\"<|>\"application-contract alignment, documentation accuracy\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"工作票管理问题\"<|>\"分包单位人员管理问题\"<|>\"Problems with work tickets (e.g., wrong entities, early issuance) are directly linked to mismatches in personnel records across systems like the risk control platform.\"<|>\"work authorization, personnel tracking\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"工作票管理问题\"<|>\"分包合同问题\"<|>\"Work tickets issued before contracts were signed indicate a failure in both contract and work authorization procedures, showing systemic coordination breakdown.\"<|>\"procedural sequence, operational compliance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"竣工验收方面\"<|>\"项目结（决）算方面\"<|>\"The '竣工验收方面' involves documentation and validation processes that directly feed into the '项目结（决）算方面', which relies on accurate and complete final reports.\"<|>\"finalization process, documentation chain\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"竣工验收方面\"<|>\"分包合同问题\"